      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the confirmation. I appreciate the thoroughness. \n\nThe reason I'm triple-checking is that I've seen some chatter in industry circles about her previous firm having some messy, non-publicized legal settlements involving the management team. It's probably nothing, but just to be safe—did your deep-dive specifically cross-reference her name against those types of private or civil settlements to make sure she wasn't involved? I just want to be able to tell the board we've looked into even the non-obvious stuff.",
